<title>FRANCE: Allianz France in offer for insurer stake.</title>
<headline>Allianz France in offer for insurer stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allianz Via holding France said on Thursday that is was making an offer at 1,700 francs for 11.9 percent of the capital of Rhin et Moselle Assurances in public hands.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the decision to make the offer was taken by its board on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
